    {
      "id": 61,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "Step 7 — Research Agent Activation Guide",
      "gridPos": { "x": 0, "y": 43, "w": 24, "h": 7 },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "## Step 7: Research Agent Live Activation\n\n**Port:** `:8007` | **Metrics:** `cogniforge_research_*` | **Tavily:** حي عند توفر `TAVILY_API_KEY`\n\n### التحقق الحي\n```bash\n# Health check\ncurl http://localhost:8007/health\n# → {\"status\":\"healthy\",\"service\":\"research-agent\",\"step\":\"7\",\"tavily_available\":\"true\"}\n\n# Prometheus metrics\ncurl http://localhost:8007/metrics | grep cogniforge_research\n# → cogniforge_research_startup_info{version=\"1.0.0\",step=\"7\",tavily_available=\"true\",...} 1.0\n\n# Deep research (Tavily)\ncurl -X POST http://localhost:8007/execute \\\n  -H 'Content-Type: application/json' \\\n  -d '{\"caller_id\":\"test\",\"action\":\"deep_research\",\"payload\":{\"query\":\"BAC math Algeria 2024\"}}'\n```\n\n### الخدمات النشطة بعد Step 7\n| الخدمة | المنفذ | الحالة |\n|--------|--------|--------|\n| FastAPI monolith | :8000 | ✅ ACTIVE |\n| orchestrator-service | :8006 | ✅ ACTIVE (Step 4) |\n| user-service | :8001 | ✅ ACTIVE (Step 5) |\n| planning-agent | :8002 | ✅ ACTIVE (Step 6) |\n| **research-agent** | **:8007** | **✅ ACTIVE (Step 7 — جديد)** |\n\n### الخطوة التالية (Step 8)\n- تفعيل `reasoning-agent` على `:8008`\n- أو: ترقية LangGraph checkpointer من MemorySaver إلى PostgresCheckpointer\n- أو: تفعيل Redis الحقيقي (`CACHE_TYPE=redis`)"
      }
    }
